lows Black to occupy the center with e5.\n\nReason: P: e2-e4 is chosen because it is the most principled move to fight for the center immediately. It facilitates rapid development of the kingside pieces, allowing for early castling. It gives White the best chance to press for an advantage from move one.\n\nAnswer: P: e2-e4"}
